! HVAC system type of every zone from the xlsx (Zone and HVAC System Summary, HVAC System Type Dictionary): 5 Packaged VAV with reheat (packaged rooftop VAV, direct expansion cooling, hot-water fossil fuel boiler for the reheat) for the classroom pods, the corridors, the computer classroom, the lobby, the mechanical room, the bathroom, the offices and the library; 3 PSZ-AC (packaged rooftop air conditioner, constant volume, direct expansion cooling, fossil fuel furnace) for the gym, the kitchen and the cafeteria. The xlsx names the HVAC system of each zone (raw_data column I): VAV_POD_1, VAV_POD_2, VAV_POD_3, VAV_OTHER, PSZ-AC_2:5, PSZ-AC_1:6 and PSZ-AC_2:7. All equipment data are EnergyPlus defaults.
! Three thermostats (xlsx Schedule Summary, Heating Set Point and Cooling Set Point): mechanical room and bathroom (both set points of the space type Mechanical Room, Bathroom), gym, kitchen and cafeteria (heating set point Others, cooling set point Gym, Kitchen, Cafeteria) and all other zones (space type Others).
