    ,                             !- Constant Heating Setpoint
    CLGSETP_SCH_Setup;            !- Cooling Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Cooling Set Point', rows 242/243/244 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun), space type Mechanical Room, Bathroom.

